  "method": "Anchored Dawid-Skene over five latent report states per target (NEG, NOT_MENTIONED, LOW, HEDGED, POS) on each family representative's native symbols, fitted by EM on all reports without labels, tempering tau=0.15 chosen by held-out-source likelihood; P(y) = sum_k q_k sigmoid(beta_k + alpha_t + gamma z) fitted by MAP on gold with gold-tuned and gold-copying roots removed on gold rows. Silver rows only; gold rows keep combined_v1 values and the loader applies official gold overrides. Roots are lineage-level public report extractions plus JevK5 v3 attributes, merged into families at mean silver kappa >= 0.9, with derived roots {'zhen_v7': 'pilkwang'} merged into their parent's family. Before averaging, not-mentioned, below-threshold and hedged codes (anchor maps and silent symbols) take the pooled gold positive rate of their state from rebuild_state_v1 {1: 0.1347, 2: 0.3448, 3: 0.6125}; negative and positive codes keep each source's own value.",
